 "statement": "In an odd-order abelian group, the nonidentity three-sum support of a signed base of 2m distinct nonzero points is at most binom(2m+2,3)-2m(m-1); at m=4 the ceiling is 96, attained by the fixed F_1009 source base, so equal-size signed bases on its degree-5 horizontal pair cannot improve its uniform three-sum yield."
